---
<section class="side" id="pessoais" aria-label="Projetos pessoais">
  <span class="note">section#pessoais · "do outro lado" do túnel · projetos pessoais com link pro GitHub</span>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="fileline" data-file="ls ./side-projects"></p>
    <div data-reveal>
    <p class="eyebrow">do outro lado — projetos pessoais</p>
    <h2 class="h2">Também construo<br>por <span style="color:var(--cyan)">conta própria</span>.</h2>
    <div class="side-grid">
      <article class="side-card" style="--c:#22D3EE">
        <div class="side-cover"><svg viewBox="0 0 400 200" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="#0A0B14" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><rect x="160" y="18" width="80" height="168" rx="14" fill="rgba(10,11,20,.12)"/><path d="M174 44h52M174 56h30"/><rect x="172" y="70" width="56" height="26" rx="6"/><rect x="172" y="104" width="56" height="26" rx="6" fill="rgba(10,11,20,.2)"/><rect x="172" y="138" width="56" height="26" rx="6"/><path d="M262 60h70M262 76h48M262 104h70M262 120h36" opacity=".5"/><path d="M70 64h60M70 80h40" opacity=".5"/><circle cx="96" cy="118" r="20" opacity=".5"/><path d="M88 118l6 6 12-12" opacity=".7"/></g></svg><span class="yr">2026</span></div>
        <div class="side-body">
          <h3>Service Quote</h3>
          <p>App mobile para criar e gerenciar orçamentos de serviços: busca, filtros por status, cálculo automático com desconto e persistência local.</p>
          <div class="chips"><span>React Native</span><span>Expo</span><span>TypeScript</span><span>AsyncStorage</span></div>
          <a class="go" href="https://github.com/RicardoBaldrez/ServiceQuote">ver código no GitHub →</a>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="side-card" style="--c:#FF2E88">
        <div class="side-cover"><svg viewBox="0 0 400 200" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="#0A0B14" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="118" y="40" width="164" height="120" rx="12" fill="rgba(10,11,20,.12)"/><path d="M118 70h164"/><rect x="134" y="86" width="40" height="22" rx="5"/><rect x="180" y="86" width="40" height="22" rx="5"/><rect x="226" y="86" width="40" height="22" rx="5" fill="rgba(10,11,20,.2)"/><path d="M134 126h132M134 142h90" opacity=".7"/><g opacity=".55"><circle cx="72" cy="86" r="18"/><path d="M72 96V76M64 84l8-8 8 8"/><circle cx="72" cy="134" r="18"/><path d="M72 124v20M64 136l8 8 8-8"/></g><path d="M314 120l18-20 14 10 22-28" opacity=".6"/></g></svg><span class="yr">2026</span></div>
        <div class="side-body">
          <h3>DT Money</h3>
          <p>App mobile de finanças pessoais, em desenvolvimento: login e cadastro com formulários validados em React Hook Form e Yup, navegação entre rotas públicas e privadas e interface em NativeWind.</p>
          <div class="chips"><span>React Native</span><span>Expo</span><span>TypeScript</span><span>NativeWind</span><span>React Hook Form</span><span>Yup</span></div>
          <a class="go" href="https://github.com/RicardoBaldrez/dt-money">ver código no GitHub →</a>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="side-card" style="--c:#B6F43C">
        <div class="side-cover"><svg viewBox="0 0 400 200" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="#0A0B14" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><rect x="160" y="18" width="80" height="168" rx="14" fill="rgba(10,11,20,.12)"/><circle cx="200" cy="92" r="30"/><circle cx="200" cy="92" r="18"/><circle cx="200" cy="92" r="6" fill="#0A0B14"/><path d="M174 140h52M174 154h34"/><g opacity=".5"><ellipse cx="96" cy="70" rx="34" ry="10"/><path d="M62 70v50c0 6 15 10 34 10s34-4 34-10V70"/><path d="M62 95c0 6 15 10 34 10s34-4 34-10"/></g><path d="M268 70h64M268 86h44M268 114h64M268 130h30" opacity=".5"/></g></svg><span class="yr">2025</span></div>
        <div class="side-body">
          <h3>Target</h3>
          <p>App mobile de metas financeiras: crie objetivos de economia, registre depósitos e retiradas e acompanhe o progresso de cada meta, com histórico e dados salvos localmente em SQLite.</p>
          <div class="chips"><span>React Native</span><span>Expo</span><span>Expo Router</span><span>TypeScript</span><span>SQLite</span></div>
          <a class="go" href="https://github.com/RicardoBaldrez/Target">ver código no GitHub →</a>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="side-card" style="--c:#A78BFA">
        <div class="side-cover"><svg viewBox="0 0 400 200" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="#0A0B14" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="70" y="40" width="190" height="124" rx="10" fill="rgba(10,11,20,.12)"/><path d="M70 62h190"/><circle cx="84" cy="51" r="2.5"/><circle cx="94" cy="51" r="2.5"/><circle cx="104" cy="51" r="2.5"/><path d="M104 78v72" opacity=".6"/><circle cx="104" cy="86" r="6" fill="#0A0B14"/><circle cx="104" cy="118" r="6"/><circle cx="104" cy="146" r="6"/><path d="M122 86h70M122 118h104M122 146h56" opacity=".7"/><rect x="276" y="56" width="62" height="124" rx="12" fill="rgba(10,11,20,.2)"/><path d="M296 66h22"/><rect x="286" y="80" width="42" height="30" rx="5"/><path d="M286 122h42M286 134h28" opacity=".7"/><path d="M340 34l3 7 7 3-7 3-3 7-3-7-7-3 7-3z" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M48 150l2 5 5 2-5 2-2 5-2-5-5-2 5-2z" stroke-width="2"/></g></svg><span class="yr">2023</span></div>
        <div class="side-body">
          <h3>Spacetime</h3>
          <p>Cápsula do tempo de memórias: textos, fotos e vídeos de momentos marcantes numa linha do tempo organizada por mês e ano. Projeto completo, com versão web, app mobile e API própria, autenticação via JWT e upload de mídias.</p>
          <div class="chips"><span>Next.js</span><span>React Native (Expo)</span><span>Tailwind</span><span>Fastify</span><span>Prisma</span><span>TypeScript</span></div>
          <a class="go" href="https://github.com/RicardoBaldrez/SpaceTime">ver código no GitHub →</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
